  "item": [
    {
      "name": "System",
      "description": "Endpoints tecnicos e de verificacao da aplicacao.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Content-Type is JSON', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Payload contains status ok', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(data).to.have.property('status', 'ok');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('lastHealthStatus', data.status);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Verifica se a API esta de pe.\n\nImplementacao atual em src/app.ts:\n- Metodo: GET\n- Rota: /health\n- Resposta esperada: 200 com `{ \"status\": \"ok\" }`\n\nOs testes desta request validam status HTTP, content-type e o payload retornado.",
            "url": "{{scheme}}://{{host}}:{{port}}{{basePath}}/health"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": "{{scheme}}://{{host}}:{{port}}{{basePath}}/health"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Questions",
      "description": "Endpoints relacionados a perguntas.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /questions/:id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "const requestedId = pm.variables.get('questionId');",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Content-Type is JSON', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response echoes the requested questionId', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(data).to.have.property('questionId', requestedId);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response contains a non-empty title', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(data).to.have.property('title');",
                  "  pm.expect(data.title).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('lastQuestionId', data.questionId);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('lastQuestionTitle', data.title);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Busca uma pergunta pelo identificador informado na URL.\n\nImplementacao atual em src/app.ts:\n- Metodo: GET\n- Rota: /questions/:id\n- Parametro de rota: `id`\n- Resposta atual: 200 com `{ questionId, title }`\n\nComportamento validado diretamente na aplicacao em 2026-04-01:\n- `questionId` replica o valor enviado na URL\n- `title` retorna uma string nao vazia\n\nOs testes desta request validam status HTTP, content-type, o espelhamento do ID informado e a presenca do titulo.",
            "url": "{{scheme}}://{{host}}:{{port}}{{basePath}}/questions/{{questionId}}"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": "{{scheme}}://{{host}}:{{port}}{{basePath}}/questions/{{questionId}}"
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"questionId\": \"question-123\",\n  \"title\": \"Pergunta de exemplo\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
